### IntelliJ HTTP Client (Ultimate edition). Click the green arrow beside each request.
### Swagger UI at http://localhost:8081 does the same thing in any browser.

### Read the menu board
GET http://localhost:8080/menu

### Order from Cal's truck
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dish": "chili", "servings": 12, "heat": "medium" }

### Same order, Vendor B's truck. Same menu, different kitchen.
POST http://localhost:8082/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dish": "chili", "servings": 12, "heat": "medium" }

### Somebody always tries
GET http://localhost:8080/recipe

### Off the menu
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dish": "tacos", "servings": 4 }
